# expect: E223
# 2.6: an asset with more than nine decimals is refused, not truncated and not
# warned about. Eighteen decimals is an artefact of wei, not a requirement of
# money, and it puts u64 minor units at 18.44 tokens.
#
# This fixture needs a resolver reporting 18 decimals for the named mint, so
# it belongs to the resolver pass rather than to the text-only rules.
charter high-decimals version 1
resolver full@41
timezone UTC

  asset DAI_maker = mint://DAI/MakerDAO/0x6b175474e89094c44da98b954eedeac495271d0f/eip155:1

  limit monthly
    amount 500.00 DAI_maker
    per fixed month
